Third-party material bundled in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

test/fixtures/anthropic-official/
    A vendored snapshot of github.com/anthropics/skills, retained as a
    parser-conformance corpus and tokenizer calibration reference. Upstream
    licences are preserved in that directory: per-skill LICENSE.txt files and
    THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. This project claims no rights over that material.

calibration/labelled-pairs.json
    Contains short skill `name` and `description` excerpts quoted from public
    GitHub repositories for the purpose of measuring and publishing detector
    accuracy. Each excerpt is attributed to its source repository and path.
